  "changes": [
    {
      "file": ".changes/add-biome-specific.md",
      "type": "feat",
      "scope": "laboratory",
      "bump": "minor",
      "packages": [
        "java@ender_infection_colored"
      ],
      "body": "Fix the natural laboratory chunk-lighting deadlock and open-door clearance. Import attributed HBM laboratory, ruined factory and arctic station structures, plus the MIT Church of Sin; preserve upstream architecture, licenses and source NBTs. Add chunk-bounded, resumable /enderbuild placement and optional local Lua Lab import. Stop naturally generating the old box-shaped laboratories while retaining six debug layouts, lift platforms and metal service ladders. GeckoLib 4.4.9 for Forge 1.20.1 remains required: https://modrinth.com/mod/geckolib/version/RBA7lJaW",
      "commit": "8eec4e05af7e6ccf28bd83e07996b2a026ead594",
      "commit_url": "https://github.com/fl749731-lab/ender-infection/commit/8eec4e05af7e6ccf28bd83e07996b2a026ead594",
      "author": "fl749731-lab"
    },
    {
      "file": ".changes/connected-highland-expansion.md",
      "type": "fix",
      "scope": "expansion",
      "bump": "patch",
      "packages": [
        "java@ender_infection_colored"
      ],
      "body": "修复节点忽略扩张计时、只搜索上方三格和偏向旧覆盖的问题。新增连通坡面与崖面攀升、高台前哨、旧感染带接力、按未覆盖地形与肥力选址、付费补建和旧节点记录兼容；半径只为可用前沿付费，母体升级/和平孵化保留网络周转金，高地收入与扩张搜索高度一致。增加原生 Forge 扩张回归与 /enderstrategy 诊断。",
      "commit": "f44e1a434e9ac8c97f36032a0f35bc8e05c12cce",
      "commit_url": "https://github.com/fl749731-lab/ender-infection/commit/f44e1a434e9ac8c97f36032a0f35bc8e05c12cce",
      "author": "fl749731-lab"
    },
    {
      "file": ".changes/creature-concept-silhouettes.md",
      "type": "fix",
      "scope": "ender_infection_colored",
      "bump": "patch",
      "packages": [
        "java@ender_infection_colored"
      ],
      "body": "按生态、战斗和巨兽设计图重建 14 种怪物的主体轮廓、骨甲与功能器官，保留紫晶自发光、原有体型高度和攻击时序，并加入正反面与攻击姿态的实机检查。\n\n通过 Blockbench MCP 原生编辑与保存进一步细化分层骨甲、圆润囊体、低伏头部和眼窝；调整喷吐者前倾姿态与背晶、搬运兽背囊、蛛母腹部以及卫士盾牌。导出器兼容 Blockbench 5 的独立 groups 数据，默认直接导出已保存原件，避免覆盖 MCP 编辑结果。",
      "commit": "2eecf5a186491bc774fc39da5e7b8462534eb0ea",
      "commit_url": "https://github.com/fl749731-lab/ender-infection/commit/2eecf5a186491bc774fc39da5e7b8462534eb0ea"
    },
    {
      "file": ".changes/creature-crystal-glow.md",
      "type": "fix",
      "scope": "ender_infection_colored",
      "bump": "patch",
      "packages": [
        "java@ender_infection_colored"
      ],
      "body": "补齐新增怪物、重做怪物、旧感染生物及母体各阶段的紫晶自发光蒙版，保留晶体暗面与尖端的完整覆盖；飞行晶刺保持自发光，并增加零环境光的正反面实机检查。",
      "commit": "2eecf5a186491bc774fc39da5e7b8462534eb0ea",
      "commit_url": "https://github.com/fl749731-lab/ender-infection/commit/2eecf5a186491bc774fc39da5e7b8462534eb0ea"
    },
    {
